From c22655ddb20b457fd458b3e883218c8a3c36552d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rd-fork <rd-fork@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:27:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 0001 P1 authority rules for rd assets

In the Initial executor, when a domain named rd exists and outside the genesis
block: mint/burn by asset definition owner, shield by the debited account,
transparent transfer by the source account only, RegisterZkAsset by the owner
with a locked vk_transfer, metadata writes by owner (accounts: the account
itself), SetParameter/Upgrade need CanSetParameters/CanUpgradeExecutor,
rd_eligible on mint/transfer/shield. R9 (added): grant/revoke, unregister of rd
things and confidential policy transitions only by the owner. The detached
parallel path falls back to sequential in rd mode.
